            'ADAM-46000355132D#$#4600-03-551-32D HD LEVER#$#Designed to operate 4300 4500 and 4900 Series Deadlatches with either an upward or downward motion. 4600 Deadlatch Handles can be retrofitted in the field onto the 2190/2290 Interconnected Deadbolt/Deadlatch. Shipped handed but easily reconfigured to accommodate either door swing. MV and MN handle types cannot be re-handed. The patented adjustable drive mechanism allows the escutcheon to be set back from the door edge at the time of installation to provide additional clearance. Monitoring switch optional to provide signal when lever is actuated.  This listing: part 4600-03-551-32D HD LEVER in 32D Satin Stainless Steel finish.#$#TRUE#$#A#$#Order As Needed#$#Ne/w /Par/t#$##$#Trims / Knobs#$##$#4600-03-551-32D HD LEVER SQUARE HANDLE LH',
