            'KROM-7500R630#$#7500 R 630#$#<p>The <strong>KROM-7500R630</strong> is Grade 2 ANSI A156.3 certified stainless steel (630) 3ft long <strong>rim touch bar exit device</strong>. For 36³ wide doors and is field adjustable to 30³ and features an extruded anodized aluminum push bar with stainless steel springs and a stainless steel latch providing a 3/4³ latchbolt throw with a 5/8³ deadlatch along with a 2-3/4³ backset covering 161 door prep and supplied with latch and strike filler plates. The device includes a surface-mounted strike for a 5/8³ door stop with shim with a double-door strike available and has a projection of 2-1/2³ reduced to 1-7/8³ when dogged. It requires a minimum stile width of 4-1/4³ is reversible and non-handed and is suitable for 1-3/4³ thick doors. Recommended mounting height is 41³ from the finished floor to the centerline of the push rail. The device is supplied with sheet metal and machine screws includes a rim cylinder (all key trims include cylinders except PLED) features dogging by 1/2-turn hex key and is available in aluminum stainless steel and black finishes backed by a 10-year limited warranty.</p>#$#TRUE#$#A#$#Stock#$#1L/05/14E/002#$##$#Exit Devices#$##$#7500 R 630 RIM EXIT DEVICE',
